OL,3,GNEWSADales wind farm would 'spoil'
OL,4,Aview, says former PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FFred. Olsen Renewables, which is
OL,7,Fseeking permission for the development
OL,8,Fin Arkengarthdale and Teesdale,
OL,9,Fpreviously said it would work with the
OL,10,Flocal community to address concerns and
OL,11,Ffind "practical solutions".
